{
  "openapi": "3.0.3",
  "info": {
    "title": "PingMe API",
    "description": "PingMe personal reminder system — manage users and reminders.\n\n**HTTP surface (Stages 1–4):** create users, create/list/get/delete reminders.\n\n**Background (Stages 5–7, not HTTP):** every ~30s the scheduler claims due `PENDING` reminders and enqueues jobs; every ~10s the worker sends notifications and moves reminders to `SENT`.\n\n**Retries (Stage 7):** a transient send failure is retried up to 3 attempts in total, waiting 30s and then 60s between attempts (rounded up to the next worker tick). The reminder stays `PROCESSING` while retrying. A permanent failure, or a third failed attempt, dead-letters the job and the reminder becomes `FAILED`.\n\n**Apidog test flow — happy path**\n1. `GET /health` — confirm the app is up\n2. `POST /users` — create a user; copy `id`\n3. `POST /reminders` — use example `dueNowForWorkerTest` with that `userId`\n4. Poll `GET /reminders/{id}` until `status` becomes `PROCESSING` then `SENT` (~40s)\n5. Check app logs for the console notification block\n\n**Apidog test flow — retries (Stage 7)**\nStart the app with `--pingme.notification.console.simulate-failures=true`, then create due reminders using the examples `retryExhausted`, `permanentFailure` and `flakyRetry`. The marker in the title (`[fail-transient]`, `[fail-permanent]`, `[flaky]`) makes the console sender fail on purpose. Poll `GET /reminders/{id}`:\n- `[fail-permanent]` → `FAILED` after one attempt (~40s)\n- `[fail-transient]` → stays `PROCESSING` for ~2–3 min, then `FAILED`\n- `[flaky]` → usually `SENT` after 0–2 retries\n\nAttempt counts and errors are not exposed over HTTP. Watch the WARN/ERROR log lines, or query the `reminder_jobs` table (`attempt_count`, `last_error`, `next_attempt_at`).",
    "version": "0.0.1-SNAPSHOT"
  },
  "servers": [
    {
      "url": "http://localhost:8080",
      "description": "Local development"
    }
  ],
  "tags": [
    {
      "name": "Health",
      "description": "Liveness probe"
    },
    {
      "name": "Hello",
      "description": "Greeting endpoint (Stage 1 demo)"
    },
    {
      "name": "Users",
      "description": "User management"
    },
    {
      "name": "Reminders",
      "description": "Reminder CRUD. Status changes after create come from the background scheduler/worker, not from these endpoints."
    }
  ],
  "paths": {
    "/health": {
      "get": {
        "tags": ["Health"],
        "summary": "Liveness probe",
        "description": "Lightweight check that the process is up. Does not verify PostgreSQL.",
        "operationId": "health",
        "responses": {
          "200": {
            "description": "Service is up",
            "content": {
              "application/json": {
                "schema": { "$ref": "#/components/schemas/HealthResponse" },
                "example": { "status": "UP" }
              }
            }
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "/hello": {
      "get": {
        "tags": ["Hello"],
        "summary": "Greeting message",
        "description": "Stage 1 demo endpoint. Confirms DI + REST wiring.",
        "operationId": "hello",
        "responses": {
          "200": {
            "description": "Greeting returned",
            "content": {
              "application/json": {
                "schema": { "$ref": "#/components/schemas/HelloResponse" },
                "example": { "message": "Hello from PingMe" }
              }
            }
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "/users": {
      "post": {
        "tags": ["Users"],
        "summary": "Create a user",
        "description": "Creates a user. Email must be unique. Use the returned `id` as `userId` when creating reminders.",
        "operationId": "createUser",
        "requestBody": {
          "required": true,
          "content": {
            "application/json": {
              "schema": { "$ref": "#/components/schemas/CreateUserRequest" },
              "examples": {
                "ada": {
                  "summary": "Standard user",
                  "value": {
                    "name": "Ada Lovelace",
                    "email": "ada@example.com"
                  }
                }
              }
            }
          }
        },
        "responses": {
          "201": {
            "description": "User created",
            "content": {
              "application/json": {
                "schema": { "$ref": "#/components/schemas/UserResponse" },
                "example": {
                  "id": 1,
                  "name": "Ada Lovelace",
                  "email": "ada@example.com",
                  "createdAt": "2026-11-06T09:00:00Z"
                }
              }
            }
          },
          "400": {
            "description": "Validation error (blank name, invalid email, etc.)",
            "content": {
              "application/json": {
                "schema": { "$ref": "#/components/schemas/ErrorResponse" },
                "example": {
                  "timestamp": "2026-11-06T09:00:00Z",
                  "status": 400,
                  "error": "Bad Request",
                  "message": "email: must be a well-formed email address"
                }
              }
            }
          },
          "409": {
            "description": "Duplicate email",
            "content": {
              "application/json": {
                "schema": { "$ref": "#/components/schemas/ErrorResponse" },
                "example": {
                  "timestamp": "2026-11-06T09:00:00Z",
                  "status": 409,
                  "error": "Conflict",
                  "message": "User with email already exists: ada@example.com"
                }
              }
            }
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "/reminders": {
      "post": {
        "tags": ["Reminders"],
        "summary": "Create a reminder for an existing user",
        "description": "Creates a reminder in `PENDING` status.\n\n- Use a **future** `scheduledTime` for normal storage/list tests.\n- Use a **past** (or near-now) `scheduledTime` to trigger Stage 5/6: within ~30s the scheduler moves it to `PROCESSING` and enqueues a job; within ~10s more the worker sends the console notification and status becomes `SENT`.\n- **Stage 7:** with `pingme.notification.console.simulate-failures=true`, a title containing `[fail-transient]`, `[fail-permanent]` or `[flaky]` makes delivery fail on purpose so you can watch retries and dead-lettering. With the flag off (the default), markers are ignored and the reminder is sent normally.\n\nThere is no HTTP endpoint for jobs; observe via `GET /reminders/{id}`, application logs, and the `reminder_jobs` table.",
        "operationId": "createReminder",
        "requestBody": {
          "required": true,
          "content": {
            "application/json": {
              "schema": { "$ref": "#/components/schemas/CreateReminderRequest" },
              "examples": {
                "futureReminder": {
                  "summary": "Future reminder (stays PENDING until due)",
                  "value": {
                    "userId": 1,
                    "title": "Call John",
                    "description": "Discuss project",
                    "scheduledTime": "2030-01-15T10:00:00Z"
                  }
                },
                "dueNowForWorkerTest": {
                  "summary": "Already due — exercises scheduler + worker",
                  "description": "Replace userId with a real user id. scheduledTime in the past makes the next scheduler tick claim it.",
                  "value": {
                    "userId": 1,
                    "title": "Call John now",
                    "description": "Should move PENDING → PROCESSING → SENT",
                    "scheduledTime": "2020-01-01T10:00:00Z"
                  }
                },
                "retryExhausted": {
                  "summary": "Stage 7 — transient failure, retries exhausted",
                  "description": "Requires simulate-failures=true. Every attempt fails transiently: 3 attempts (waits of ~30s then ~60s), then the job is dead-lettered. Reminder: PENDING → PROCESSING (for ~2–3 min) → FAILED.",
                  "value": {
                    "userId": 1,
                    "title": "Gym session [fail-transient]",
                    "description": "Should retry twice, then end FAILED",
                    "scheduledTime": "2020-01-01T10:00:00Z"
                  }
                },
                "permanentFailure": {
                  "summary": "Stage 7 — permanent failure, no retry",
                  "description": "Requires simulate-failures=true. Fails permanently on the first attempt and goes straight to the dead letter queue. Reminder: PENDING → PROCESSING → FAILED (~40s).",
                  "value": {
                    "userId": 1,
                    "title": "Pay rent [fail-permanent]",
                    "description": "Should end FAILED after one attempt",
                    "scheduledTime": "2020-01-01T10:00:00Z"
                  }
                },
                "flakyRetry": {
                  "summary": "Stage 7 — flaky provider, succeeds on retry",
                  "description": "Requires simulate-failures=true. Each attempt fails ~50% of the time. Usually ends SENT after 0–2 retries; occasionally FAILED if all 3 attempts fail.",
                  "value": {
                    "userId": 1,
                    "title": "Dentist appointment [flaky]",
                    "description": "Should usually end SENT after a retry",
                    "scheduledTime": "2020-01-01T10:00:00Z"
                  }
                }
              }
            }
          }
        },
        "responses": {
          "201": {
            "description": "Reminder created (`PENDING`)",
            "content": {
              "application/json": {
                "schema": { "$ref": "#/components/schemas/ReminderResponse" },
                "example": {
                  "id": 1,
                  "userId": 1,
                  "title": "Call John",
                  "description": "Discuss project",
                  "scheduledTime": "2030-01-15T10:00:00Z",
                  "status": "PENDING",
                  "createdAt": "2026-11-06T09:00:00Z"
                }
              }
            }
          },
          "400": {
            "description": "Validation error (blank title, missing userId/scheduledTime, etc.)",
            "content": {
              "application/json": {
                "schema": { "$ref": "#/components/schemas/ErrorResponse" },
                "example": {
                  "timestamp": "2026-11-06T09:00:00Z",
                  "status": 400,
                  "error": "Bad Request",
                  "message": "title: must not be blank"
                }
              }
            }
          },
          "404": {
            "description": "User not found",
            "content": {
              "application/json": {
                "schema": { "$ref": "#/components/schemas/ErrorResponse" },
                "example": {
                  "timestamp": "2026-11-06T09:00:00Z",
                  "status": 404,
                  "error": "Not Found",
                  "message": "User not found: 999999"
                }
              }
            }
          }
        }
      },
      "get": {
        "tags": ["Reminders"],
        "summary": "List reminders (optionally filtered by userId)",
        "description": "Returns all reminders, or only those for `userId` when the query param is set. Useful after creating a due reminder to watch status change over time.",
        "operationId": "listReminders",
        "parameters": [
          {
            "name": "userId",
            "in": "query",
            "required": false,
            "description": "Filter reminders by user ID. Omit to list all reminders.",
            "schema": { "type": "integer", "format": "int64" },
            "example": 1
          }
        ],
        "responses": {
          "200": {
            "description": "List of reminders",
            "content": {
              "application/json": {
                "schema": {
                  "type": "array",
                  "items": { "$ref": "#/components/schemas/ReminderResponse" }
                },
                "examples": {
                  "pendingAndSent": {
                    "summary": "Mixed statuses after background processing",
                    "value": [
                      {
                        "id": 1,
                        "userId": 1,
                        "title": "Call John",
                        "description": "Discuss project",
                        "scheduledTime": "2030-01-15T10:00:00Z",
                        "status": "PENDING",
                        "createdAt": "2026-11-06T09:00:00Z"
                      },
                      {
                        "id": 2,
                        "userId": 1,
                        "title": "Call John now",
                        "description": "Should move PENDING → PROCESSING → SENT",
                        "scheduledTime": "2020-01-01T10:00:00Z",
                        "status": "SENT",
                        "createdAt": "2026-11-06T09:01:00Z"
                      }
                    ]
                  }
                }
              }
            }
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "/reminders/{id}": {
      "get": {
        "tags": ["Reminders"],
        "summary": "Get a single reminder by ID",
        "description": "Fetch one reminder. Poll this after creating a due reminder to see `PENDING` → `PROCESSING` → `SENT`, or `PROCESSING` → `FAILED` when delivery failed permanently or ran out of retries (Stage 7). While a retry is waiting, the status stays `PROCESSING`.",
        "operationId": "getReminder",
        "parameters": [
          {
            "name": "id",
            "in": "path",
            "required": true,
            "description": "Reminder ID returned from POST /reminders",
            "schema": { "type": "integer", "format": "int64" },
            "example": 1
          }
        ],
        "responses": {
          "200": {
            "description": "Reminder found",
            "content": {
              "application/json": {
                "schema": { "$ref": "#/components/schemas/ReminderResponse" },
                "examples": {
                  "pending": {
                    "summary": "Just created",
                    "value": {
                      "id": 1,
                      "userId": 1,
                      "title": "Call John",
                      "description": "Discuss project",
                      "scheduledTime": "2030-01-15T10:00:00Z",
                      "status": "PENDING",
                      "createdAt": "2026-11-06T09:00:00Z"
                    }
                  },
                  "sent": {
                    "summary": "After worker delivered notification",
                    "value": {
                      "id": 2,
                      "userId": 1,
                      "title": "Call John now",
                      "description": "Should move PENDING → PROCESSING → SENT",
                      "scheduledTime": "2020-01-01T10:00:00Z",
                      "status": "SENT",
                      "createdAt": "2026-11-06T09:01:00Z"
                    }
                  },
                  "failed": {
                    "summary": "Stage 7 — delivery failed and job was dead-lettered",
                    "value": {
                      "id": 3,
                      "userId": 1,
                      "title": "Gym session [fail-transient]",
                      "description": "Should retry twice, then end FAILED",
                      "scheduledTime": "2020-01-01T10:00:00Z",
                      "status": "FAILED",
                      "createdAt": "2026-11-06T09:02:00Z"
                    }
                  }
                }
              }
            }
          },
          "404": {
            "description": "Reminder not found",
            "content": {
              "application/json": {
                "schema": { "$ref": "#/components/schemas/ErrorResponse" },
                "example": {
                  "timestamp": "2026-11-06T09:00:00Z",
                  "status": 404,
                  "error": "Not Found",
                  "message": "Reminder not found: 999"
                }
              }
            }
          }
        }
      },
      "delete": {
        "tags": ["Reminders"],
        "summary": "Delete a reminder",
        "description": "Deletes the reminder in any status. Its delivery jobs (including dead-lettered ones) are deleted with it by the database (`ON DELETE CASCADE`, migration V6), so this works even after the scheduler has enqueued a job.",
        "operationId": "deleteReminder",
        "parameters": [
          {
            "name": "id",
            "in": "path",
            "required": true,
            "schema": { "type": "integer", "format": "int64" },
            "example": 1
          }
        ],
        "responses": {
          "204": {
            "description": "Reminder deleted (no content)"
          },
          "404": {
            "description": "Reminder not found",
            "content": {
              "application/json": {
                "schema": { "$ref": "#/components/schemas/ErrorResponse" },
                "example": {
                  "timestamp": "2026-11-06T09:00:00Z",
                  "status": 404,
                  "error": "Not Found",
                  "message": "Reminder not found: 999"
                }
              }
            }
          }
        }
      }
    }
  },
  "components": {
    "schemas": {
      "HealthResponse": {
        "type": "object",
        "properties": {
          "status": { "type": "string", "example": "UP" }
        },
        "required": ["status"]
      },
      "HelloResponse": {
        "type": "object",
        "properties": {
          "message": { "type": "string", "example": "Hello from PingMe" }
        },
        "required": ["message"]
      },
      "CreateUserRequest": {
        "type": "object",
        "properties": {
          "name": {
            "type": "string",
            "minLength": 1,
            "maxLength": 255,
            "example": "Ada Lovelace"
          },
          "email": {
            "type": "string",
            "format": "email",
            "minLength": 1,
            "maxLength": 255,
            "example": "ada@example.com"
          }
        },
        "required": ["name", "email"]
      },
      "UserResponse": {
        "type": "object",
        "properties": {
          "id": { "type": "integer", "format": "int64", "example": 1 },
          "name": { "type": "string", "example": "Ada Lovelace" },
          "email": { "type": "string", "format": "email", "example": "ada@example.com" },
          "createdAt": { "type": "string", "format": "date-time", "example": "2026-11-06T09:00:00Z" }
        },
        "required": ["id", "name", "email", "createdAt"]
      },
      "CreateReminderRequest": {
        "type": "object",
        "properties": {
          "userId": {
            "type": "integer",
            "format": "int64",
            "description": "Must be an existing user id from POST /users",
            "example": 1
          },
          "title": {
            "type": "string",
            "minLength": 1,
            "maxLength": 255,
            "example": "Call John"
          },
          "description": {
            "type": "string",
            "maxLength": 4000,
            "nullable": true,
            "example": "Discuss project"
          },
          "scheduledTime": {
            "type": "string",
            "format": "date-time",
            "description": "ISO-8601 instant (UTC recommended). Past/near-now times are claimed by the scheduler.",
            "example": "2030-01-15T10:00:00Z"
          }
        },
        "required": ["userId", "title", "scheduledTime"]
      },
      "ReminderStatus": {
        "type": "string",
        "description": "Reminder lifecycle. Transitions after create are driven by background jobs, not by REST.\n\n- `PENDING` — waiting for due time\n- `PROCESSING` — claimed by scheduler; a job is being delivered or is waiting to retry\n- `SENT` — worker delivered notification\n- `FAILED` — delivery failed permanently, or all retry attempts (default 3) failed. Terminal; the job is in the dead letter queue",
        "enum": ["PENDING", "PROCESSING", "SENT", "FAILED"],
        "example": "PENDING"
      },
      "ReminderResponse": {
        "type": "object",
        "properties": {
          "id": { "type": "integer", "format": "int64", "example": 1 },
          "userId": { "type": "integer", "format": "int64", "example": 1 },
          "title": { "type": "string", "example": "Call John" },
          "description": { "type": "string", "nullable": true, "example": "Discuss project" },
          "scheduledTime": { "type": "string", "format": "date-time", "example": "2030-01-15T10:00:00Z" },
          "status": { "$ref": "#/components/schemas/ReminderStatus" },
          "createdAt": { "type": "string", "format": "date-time", "example": "2026-11-06T09:00:00Z" }
        },
        "required": ["id", "userId", "title", "scheduledTime", "status", "createdAt"]
      },
      "ErrorResponse": {
        "type": "object",
        "properties": {
          "timestamp": { "type": "string", "format": "date-time" },
          "status": { "type": "integer", "example": 404 },
          "error": { "type": "string", "example": "Not Found" },
          "message": { "type": "string", "example": "Reminder not found: 999" }
        },
        "required": ["timestamp", "status", "error", "message"]
      }
    }
  }
}
